	["Bring 20 Deviate Hides to Nalpak."] = "Bringt Nalpak 20 Deviathäute.",
	["Bring 20 Hearts of Zeal from the Scarlet Monastery to Master Apothecary Faranell."] = "Bringt 20 Herzen des Eifers aus dem Scharlachroten Kloster zu Apothekermeister Faranell.",
